One of the Foundation jets was attacked by [[Caine]] and crash landed on a mysterious island, home to the wild Titan [[Polymaximus]]. {{source|Island of the Titans}}

The Huntik team arrives by jet at the [[The Cloisters|Cloisters]] to help [[Focauld Casterwill|Focauld]] ward off the [[Blood Spiral]]. Dante explains the use of the Power Amplifier, which [[LeBlanche]] activates to help the team in a critical moment. {{source|The Casterwill Connection}}

One of the jets was attacked by the Blood Spiral after landing in Salon, before the team had the chance to get off. It was torn apart by [[Psikofen]] and exploded. {{source|Words from Eathon}}
